[34.155242, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll inspect the working directory and environment to identify the provided input and any existing code or build setup.\r\n\r\n```\r\npwd; ls -la; echo '---'; file test 2>/dev/null; head -5 test 2>/dev/null; echo '---'; command -v upc || true; command -v upcrun || true; command -v gcc || true;\r\ngcc --version | head -1\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
