[41.371215, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m2\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[41.371767, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI found the 10,000-line k-mer input, but no existing source. I’ll analyze its structure to infer the graph semantics and design serial/parallel implementations \r\nthat agree.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nwc -l test\r\nawk -F'\\t' '{print length($1)}' test | sort -nu\r\necho '--- extension chars'; awk -F'\\t' '{print $2}' test | fold -w1 | sort | uniq -c; awk -F'\\t' '{print $3}' test | fold -w1 | sort | uniq -c\r\necho '--- first lines chars'; head -3 test | cat -A\r\necho '--- lookup extension consistency sample'; head -50 test | awk -F'\\t' '{print $1\"\\t\"$2\"\\t\"$3}'\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[41.372105, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠏\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[41.388949, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
