[50.309323, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m3\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[50.309767, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe tab-separated field contains both extensions (left and right), e.g. `FG`. I’ll now inspect graph connectivity properties—uniqueness, extension consistency, \r\nbranching, and terminal nodes—to determine the intended traversal rules.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nawk -F'\\t' '{print substr($2,1,1)}' test | sort | uniq -c\r\necho '--- right'; awk -F'\\t' '{print substr($2,2,1)}' test | sort | uniq -c\r\necho '--- unique kmers'; cut -f1 test | sort | uniq | wc -l\r\necho '--- F lines'; awk -F'\\t' 'substr($2,1,1)==\"F\" || substr($2,2,1)==\"F\"' test\r\necho '--- kmer duplicates'; cut -f1 test | sort | uniq -d | head\r\necho '--- check edges to next line based on right ext'; awk -F'\\t' 'NR==1{prev=$1; pr=substr($2,2,1); next} {km=$1; if (pr!=\"F\") {exp=substr(prev,2) pr; \r\nif(km!=exp) print NR, prev,pr,km,exp}}' test | head\r\n\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[50.311076, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[50.335598, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[50.336395, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n   2596 A\r\n   2434 C\r\n      6 F\r\n   2495 G\r\n   2469 T\r\n--- right\r\n   2607 A\r\n   2442 C\r\n      5 F\r\n   2486 G\r\n   2460 T\r\n--- unique kmers\r\n10000\r\n--- F lines\r\nATAGCCAGTGCCTGATACT     FG\r\nAATGTGTCACATATGACCA     GF\r\nAGCCATTAACGATTGTCCG     FG\r\nACAATATCATTGCGGCTAT     AF\r\nATCCCATTTATCGTATGGA     FG\r\nAGAGCCTTCTCCCAAACCA     CF\r\nCGATAAACGGCGTCACGTT     FG\r\nGCCCCAGACCGTACCAAAC     TF\r\nAGCCACAACGTGCTGCTGG     FC\r\nCAACAACCATTACCACCAG     AF\r\nAGCCTTTATCACTGAGGCT     FA\r\n--- kmer duplicates\r\n--- check edges to next line based on right ext\r\nawk: line 1: syntax error at or near =\r\nawk: line 1: syntax error at or near )\r\n\r\n"]
[50.337469, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
