[83.565711, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m6\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2KI need to determine whether the terminal extension character should be appended when its next k-mer is absent. I’ll inspect the input around that boundary and \r\nthe path layout.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\ngrep -n 'ACTGACCGGAACAGCGTTT' test\r\necho '--- last 20 lines'; tail -20 test\r\necho '--- occurrences of target prefix'; grep -n 'CTGACCGGAACAGCGTTTA' test || true\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nrows=[l.rstrip().split('\\t') for l in open('test')]\r\nd={k:e for k,e in rows}\r\nk='ACTGACCGGAACAGCGTTT'; e=d[k]\r\nprint('last row',k,e)\r\nprint('suffix',k[1:]+e[1], 'in', k[1:]+e[1] in d)\r\n# find all lines where kmer equals target?\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[83.566135, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[83.591221, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[83.591542, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n10000:ACTGACCGGAACAGCGTTT       CA\r\n--- last 20 lines\r\nAGGAGATCAAAGATGTGCC     GA\r\nGGAGATCAAAGATGTGCCA     AC\r\nGAGATCAAAGATGTGCCAC     GT\r\nAGATCAAAGATGTGCCACT     GG\r\nGATCAAAGATGTGCCACTG     AA\r\nATCAAAGATGTGCCACTGA     GC\r\nTCAAAGATGTGCCACTGAC     AC\r\nCAAAGATGTGCCACTGACC     TG\r\nAAAGATGTGCCACTGACCG     CG\r\nAAGATGTGCCACTGACCGG     AA\r\nAGATGTGCCACTGACCGGA     AA\r\nGATGTGCCACTGACCGGAA     AC\r\nATGTGCCACTGACCGGAAC     GA\r\nTGTGCCACTGACCGGAACA     AG\r\nGTGCCACTGACCGGAACAG     TC\r\nTGCCACTGACCGGAACAGC     GG\r\nGCCACTGACCGGAACAGCG     TT\r\nCCACTGACCGGAACAGCGT     GT\r\nCACTGACCGGAACAGCGTT     CT\r\nACTGACCGGAACAGCGTTT     CA\r\n--- occurrences of target prefix\r\nlast row ACTGACCGGAACAGCGTTT CA\r\nsuffix CTGACCGGAACAGCGTTTA in False\r\n\r\n"]
