[97.811118, "o", "\r\u001b[2KBerkeley UPC downloaded successfully. I’ll extract and configure it in SMP mode with the specified flags, then build and install it.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /tmp\r\nrm -rf berkeley_upc-2022.10.0\r\ntar xzf berkeley_upc-2022.10.0.tar.gz\r\ncd berkeley_upc-2022.10.0\r\n./configure --prefix=/usr/local --disable-mpi --enable-smp --disable-ibv --disable-shmem --disable-ofi --disable-ucx > /tmp/upc_configure.log 2>&1\r\nrc=$?\r\necho \"configure rc=$rc\"\r\ntail -40 /tmp/upc_configure.log\r\nexit $rc\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[97.81142, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
