[311.266535, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m15\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[311.26692, "o", "\r\u001b[2KBerkeley UPC is compiling. I’ll check its status and, once installed, validate the UPC syntax with a small test before writing the full implementation.\r\n\r\n```\r\nif [ -f /tmp/upc_build.done ]; then echo \"build done rc=$(cat /tmp/upc_build.done)\"; else echo \"build running\"; fi\r\nif [ -f /tmp/upc_install.done ]; then echo \"install done rc=$(cat /tmp/upc_install.done)\"; else echo \"install pending\"; fi\r\ntail -5 /tmp/upc_build.log 2>/dev/null\r\nls -l /usr/local/bin/upc /usr/local/bin/upcrun 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[311.267243, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[311.275761, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[311.276121, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nbuild done rc=0\r\ninstall done rc=0\r\nrm -f upcc\r\nrm -f upcrun\r\nln -s upcc_multi upcc\r\nln -s opt/upcrun upcrun\r\ngmake[1]: Leaving directory '/tmp/berkeley_upc-2022.10.0'\r\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root 17 Nov  1 07:29 /usr/local/bin/upcrun -> ../opt/bin/upcrun\r\n\r\n"]
[311.278862, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25l"]
