[412.763652, "o", "\r\u001b[2KSerial works and produced six valid DNA contigs. I’ll check their lengths and inspect the truncated-final-contig boundary before implementing the UPC version.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nawk '{print NR,length($0),substr($0,1,30),substr($0,length($0)-29)}' serial.out\r\necho '--- expected path lengths with/without dangling final extension'\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\n# last path nodes count from previous analysis: 209, k=19 -> 227 bases; with terminal A -> 228\r\nprint('path nodes 209, expected sequence', 209+19-1, 'with terminal extension', 209+19)\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
