[459.867166, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe UPC compiler wrapper does not accept `-O2` in that form. I’ll compile with its supported optimization flag and fix the shell status check.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\n/usr/local/opt/bin/upcc -network=smp -O -o /app/pgen /app/pgen.upc > /tmp/pgen_build.log 2>&1\r\nrc=$?\r\necho \"compile_rc=$rc\"\r\ncat /tmp/pgen_build.log\r\nls -l /app/pgen 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
