[464.330438, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe UPC program compiled. I’ll run it with four threads, then compare the multiset of contigs against `serial.out`.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nrm -f pgen_*.out\r\n/usr/local/bin/upcrun -n 4 -shared-heap 256MB /app/pgen /app/test > /tmp/pgen_run_stdout.log 2> /tmp/pgen_run_stderr.log\r\nrc=$?\r\necho \"run_rc=$rc\"\r\necho '--- stdout'; cat /tmp/pgen_run_stdout.log\r\necho '--- stderr'; cat /tmp/pgen_run_stderr.log\r\necho '--- files'; ls -l /app/pgen_*.out 2>/dev/null\r\necho '--- line counts'; wc -l /app/pgen_*.out 2>/dev/null\r\necho '--- comparison'\r\ncat /app/pgen_*.out 2>/dev/null | sort > /tmp/pgen_sorted.txt\r\nsort /app/serial.out > /tmp/serial_sorted.txt\r\ndiff -u /tmp/serial_sorted.txt /tmp/pgen_sorted.txt && echo IDENTICAL_CONTIGS\r\nawk '{if ($0 !~ /^[ACGT]+$/) print \"BAD\",FILENAME,NR,$0}' /app/pgen_*.out | head\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[464.330578, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[465.386442, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[465.387075, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nrun_rc=0\r\n--- stdout\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 0 of 4 on 20583e9ac8c2 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 0 of 4, pid=46696)\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 2 of 4 on 20583e9ac8c2 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 2 of 4, pid=46715)\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 1 of 4 on 20583e9ac8c2 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 1 of 4, pid=46714)\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 3 of 4 on 20583e9ac8c2 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 3 of 4, pid=46716)\r\n--- stderr\r\nUPC Runtime warning: Requested shared memory (256 MB) > available (9 MB) on node 0 (20583e9ac8c2): using 9 MB per thread instead\r\n--- files\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 5067 Nov  1 07:31 /app/pgen_0.out\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 1228 Nov  1 07:31 /app/pgen_1.out\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root    0 Nov  1 07:31 /app/pgen_2.out\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 3820 Nov  1 07:31 /app/pgen_3.out\r\n--- line counts\r\n    2 /app/pgen_0.out\r\n    2 /app/pgen_1.out\r\n    0 /app/pgen_2.out\r\n    2 /app/pgen_3.out\r\n    6 total\r\n--- comparison\r\nIDENTICAL_CONTIGS\r\n\r\n"]
