[483.082033, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe build and four-thread verification pass. I’ll now verify determinism across different UPC thread counts, from one to eight threads.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nfor t in 1 2 3 8; do\r\n  echo \"===== threads=$t =====\"\r\n  ./verify.sh \"$t\" >/tmp/verify_$t.log 2>&1\r\n  rc=$?\r\n  echo \"rc=$rc\"\r\n  tail -2 /tmp/verify_$t.log\r\n  wc -l pgen_*.out | tail -1\r\ndone\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
