[511.194789, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe crash is intermittent only at two threads. I’ll capture a GASNet backtrace to locate whether it occurs during traversal or collective cleanup.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nfor i in 1 2 3 4 5 6; do\r\n  rm -f pgen_*.out\r\n  GASNET_BACKTRACE=1 /usr/local/bin/upcrun -n 2 -shared-heap 256MB ./pgen test >/tmp/bt_out.log 2>/tmp/bt_err.log\r\n  rc=$?\r\n  echo \"attempt $i rc=$rc\"\r\n  if [ $rc -ne 0 ]; then cat /tmp/bt_out.log; cat /tmp/bt_err.log; break; fi\r\ndone\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠋\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
