[528.33321, "o", "\r\u001b[2K```\r\ngrep -R \"upcr_free\\|upc_free\" -n /usr/local/opt/include /usr/local/opt/share 2>/dev/null | head -40\r\necho '--- bupc extern'; sed -n '225,255p' /usr/local/opt/include/bupc_extern.h\r\necho '--- upcr.h around'; sed -n '470,500p' /usr/local/opt/include/upcr.h\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
