[593.821553, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m40\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\u001b[2K```\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nfor i,l in enumerate(open('/tmp/edge/cycle')):\r\n    print(i,repr(l),l.count('\\t'),l.split('\\t'))\r\nPY\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
