[627.629221, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m44\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[627.62961, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe cycle output is correct for a circular path: a maximal cycle of four 3-mers linearizes to six bases, and both versions agree. I’ll remove the compiler \r\nwarning and run a final comprehensive thread-count and stability check.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nsed -i '1{/^#define _GNU_SOURCE$/d;}' pgen.upc\r\nhead -3 pgen.upc\r\nmake clean >/tmp/final_build.log 2>&1\r\nmake >>/tmp/final_build.log 2>&1\r\nrc=$?\r\necho build_rc=$rc\r\ncat /tmp/final_build.log\r\nls -l serial pgen\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[627.631561, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[629.081561, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[629.081858, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n#include <upc.h>\r\n#include <stdio.h>\r\n#include <stdlib.h>\r\nbuild_rc=0\r\nrm -f serial pgen /app/serial.out /app/pgen_*.out\r\ncc -O2 -std=gnu99 -Wall -Wextra -o serial serial.c\r\n/usr/local/opt/bin/upcc -network=smp -O -o pgen pgen.upc\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 853872 Nov  1 07:34 pgen\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root  71392 Nov  1 07:34 serial\r\n\r\n"]
[629.087498, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
