[663.068112, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m46\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[663.070751, "o", "\r\u001b[2KAll thread counts and stress runs pass. I’ll perform one last clean build via the Makefile’s `verify` target so the final artifacts and outputs come from a \r\nfresh 4-thread build.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nmake clean\r\nmake\r\nmake verify THREADS=4\r\necho '--- final artifact summary'\r\nls -l /app/Makefile /app/serial.c /app/pgen.upc /app/serial /app/pgen\r\necho '--- final output summary'\r\nls -l /app/serial.out /app/pgen_*.out\r\necho '--- contig lengths'\r\nawk '{print \"serial\", NR, length($0)}' /app/serial.out\r\ncat /app/pgen_*.out | sort | awk '{print \"pgen\", NR, length($0)}'\r\necho '--- final sorted diff'\r\ncat /app/pgen_*.out | sort > /tmp/final_pgen.sorted\r\nsort /app/serial.out > /tmp/final_serial.sorted\r\ndiff -u /tmp/final_serial.sorted /tmp/final_pgen.sorted && echo FINAL_IDENTICAL_CONTIGS\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[663.071101, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[663.071655, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[665.667817, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[665.668449, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nrm -f serial pgen /app/serial.out /app/pgen_*.out\r\ncc -O2 -std=gnu99 -Wall -Wextra -o serial serial.c\r\n/usr/local/opt/bin/upcc -network=smp -O -o pgen pgen.upc\r\n./serial test\r\nupcrun -n 4 -shared-heap 256MB ./pgen test\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 0 of 4 on 20583e9ac8c2 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 0 of 4, pid=48642)\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 2 of 4 on 20583e9ac8c2 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 2 of 4, pid=48661)\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 1 of 4 on 20583e9ac8c2 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 1 of 4, pid=48660)\r\nUPCR: UPC thread 3 of 4 on 20583e9ac8c2 (pshm node 0 of 1, process 3 of 4, pid=48662)\r\nUPC Runtime warning: Requested shared memory (256 MB) > available (9 MB) on node 0 (20583e9ac8c2): using 9 MB per thread instead\r\nVerification: parallel and serial contigs are identical\r\n--- final artifact summary\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root    924 Nov  1 07:32 /app/Makefile\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 853872 Nov  1 07:35 /app/pgen\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  10312 Nov  1 07:34 /app/pgen.upc\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root  71392 Nov  1 07:35 /app/serial\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root   6032 Nov  1 07:30 /app/serial.c\r\n--- final output summary\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  5067 Nov  1 07:35 /app/pgen_0.out\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  1228 Nov  1 07:35 /app/pgen_1.out\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root     0 Nov  1 07:35 /app/pgen_2.out\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root  3820 Nov  1 07:35 /app/pgen_3.out\r\n-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 10115 Nov  1 07:35 /app/serial.out\r\n--- contig lengths\r\nserial 1 3598\r\nserial 2 1467\r\nserial 3 846\r\nserial 4 380\r\nserial 5 3590\r\nserial 6 228\r\npgen 1 3590\r\npgen 2 1467\r\npgen 3 228\r\npgen 4 3598\r\npgen 5 846\r\npgen 6 380\r\n--- final sorted diff\r\nFINAL_IDENTICAL_CONTIGS\r\n\r\n"]
