[684.686995, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m47\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[684.687933, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe final artifacts are correct. As an additional robustness check, I’ll generate randomized de Bruijn inputs, shuffle their line order, and confirm serial/UPC \r\nagreement across several thread counts.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nimport random, os\r\nrandom.seed(7)\r\nos.makedirs('/tmp/rnd', exist_ok=True)\r\nfor case in range(8):\r\n    k=random.choice([5,9,13,19,23])\r\n    paths=[]\r\n    used=set()\r\n    for p in range(random.randint(1,5)):\r\n        while True:\r\n            L=random.randint(k+5,300)\r\n            s=''.join(random.choice('ACGT') for _ in range(L))\r\n            ks=[s[i:i+k] for i in range(L-k+1)]\r\n            if len(set(ks))==len(ks) and not (set(ks)&used): break\r\n        used.update(ks)\r\n        recs=[]\r\n        for i,km in enumerate(ks):\r\n            left='F' if i==0 else s[i-1]\r\n            right='F' if i==len(ks)-1 else s[i+k]\r\n            recs.append((km,left+right,s))\r\n        paths.append((s,recs))\r\n    recs=[r for s,rr in paths for r in rr]\r\n    random.shuffle(recs)\r\n    with open(f'/tmp/rnd/in{case}','w') as f:\r\n        for km,e,_ in recs: f.write(km+'\\t'+e+'\\n')\r\n    with open(f'/tmp/rnd/expect{case}','w') as f:\r\n        for s,_ in paths: f.write(s+'\\n')\r\nprint('generated')\r\nPY\r\nfor t in 2 4 7; do\r\n  echo \"=== threads $t ===\"\r\n  for c in $(seq 0 7); do\r\n    rm -f /app/pgen_*.out\r\n    ./serial /tmp/rnd/in$c\r\n    sort /app/serial.out > /tmp/rnd/s\r\n    sort /tmp/rnd/expect$c > /tmp/rnd/e\r\n    diff -u /tmp/rnd/e /tmp/rnd/s >/tmp/rnd/d1 || { echo \"case $c serial-vs-expected mismatch\"; head -20 /tmp/rnd/d1; exit 1; }\r\n    upcrun -n $t -shared-heap 256MB ./pgen /tmp/rnd/in$c >/tmp/rnd/log 2>&1 || { echo \"case $c pgen crash\"; cat /tmp/rnd/log; exit 1; }\r\n    cat /app/pgen_*.out | sort > /tmp/rnd/p\r\n    diff -u /tmp/rnd/s /tmp/rnd/p >/tmp/rnd/d2 || { echo \"case $c serial-vs-parallel mismatch\"; cat /tmp/rnd/d2; exit 1; }\r\n  done\r\n  echo \"all random cases passed\"\r\ndone\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[684.688076, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠦\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
