[713.897454, "o", "\r\u001b[2KRandomized tests passed against expected sequences for 2, 4, and 7 threads. I’ll regenerate the final `/app/test` outputs through `make verify` so the delivered\r\noutput files correspond to the provided dataset.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app\r\nmake verify THREADS=4\r\necho '--- delivered files'\r\nls -l /app/serial /app/pgen /app/Makefile /app/serial.c /app/pgen.upc /app/serial.out /app/pgen_*.out\r\necho '--- contig multiset comparison'\r\ncat /app/pgen_*.out | sort > /tmp/deliver_pgen.sorted\r\nsort /app/serial.out > /tmp/deliver_serial.sorted\r\ndiff -u /tmp/deliver_serial.sorted /tmp/deliver_pgen.sorted && echo DELIVERED_OUTPUTS_MATCH\r\nwc -l /app/serial.out\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[713.898703, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
