[717.293711, "o", "\r\u001b[2KImplementation complete. I installed and configured Berkeley UPC in SMP mode, added serial and UPC parallel de Bruijn implementations, created the Makefile, and\r\nverified that `/app/serial.out` and the combined `/app/pgen_*.out` files contain identical contig sets across multiple thread counts and randomized tests.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
